VERIFIED="2026-10-17 live on KodeKloud 339712991953: break created a BPA-on bucket, ran a script (AWS_EXECUTION_ENV=platform-lab-tidy-script -> exec-env/ in userAgent) that set PutBucketPublicAccessBlock all-false + PutBucketPolicy Allow * GetObject; anonymous GET 200; CloudTrail LookupEvents showed PutBucketPolicy after ~70-120 s, the PutBucketPublicAccessBlock several minutes later (S3 Get* bucket calls never appear); check failed uncontained, failed without note, failed with wrong EventId/no marker; contained + correct note scored 100; deleted bucket + note without time scored 60 (PENALTY 30+10); reset left nothing"
